  '# Onyx Devs Lab — Full public knowledge file',
  '',
  'Canonical website: https://hk.onyxdevslab.com/',
  'Legal entity: ONYX DEVS LAB LIMITED',
  'Hong Kong business registration number: 79051925',
  'Legal Entity Identifier (LEI): 254900Z30CLK7HKE9H46',
  'GLEIF entity status: ACTIVE',
  'GLEIF LEI record status: ISSUED',
  'Registered office: 36-40 TAI LIN PAI ROAD, UNIT B53, 2/F, KWAI CHUNG, HONG KONG 999077',
  'Registered-office source: https://www.gleif.org/lei/254900Z30CLK7HKE9H46',
  'Services: enterprise AI advisory, custom AI development, and Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE).',
  'Markets: Hong Kong, Greater China, cross-border, and global engagements.',
